  );
  // (a kit's patterns in, a preset taken: seq_ui_ack_tick, above the chips and in the gate)
  // the room between KEYS and SONG shared out (pw): the yields, in their order. The preset's < > arrows came back on either
  // side of the name box (2026-10-26; the owner: "bring back the preset arrows"), 16 design px each, and the gaps before
  // LOOP and ZOOM went from 6 / 8 to 4 / 6 to make room for them. The arrows yield after ZOOM and before LOOP (the wheel
  // over the name box still steps the presets), and come back where LOOP has gone and they fit.
  nmin = swing_px(90); lzg1 = swing_px(4); lzg2 = swing_px(6); aw = swing_px(16);
